  REGRESSED BY CHOUPO (DEV.md 4c C311) to the evaluated gamma_pm and phi
  of W. J. Hamer and Y.-C. Wu, Osmotic Coefficients and Mean Activity Coefficients of Uni-univalent Electrolytes in Water at 25 C, J. Phys. Chem. Ref. Data 1 (1972) 1047-1100, doi:10.1063/1.3253108 (Table 11, p. 1064 (m, phi, gamma), the recommended values) -- the evaluation is the
  primary source of those recommended values.  The PARAMETERS are
  Choupo's own work.  Window: 0.1-3 mol/kg at 298.15 K
  (13 points fitted, 4 interleaved points held out).
  Outside it the record is an extrapolation; off 25 C it carries no
  temperature extension of its own.
  GRADE: in-sample max error 0.464 % -> clean (capped at warning: one temperature, one evaluation);
  the held-out points 0.373 % (clean).  No human has
