| NaCl | 1:1 | 0.06 | 5 pts | high | Hamer & Wu, JPCRD 1 (1972) 1047 |
| KCl | 1:1 | 0.11 | 5 pts | high | Hamer & Wu, JPCRD 1 (1972) 1047 |
| NaBr | 1:1 | 0.17 | 5 pts | high | Hamer & Wu, JPCRD 1 (1972) 1047 |
