            origin        literature;
            method        "read at the page image, 2026-11-15 (DEV.md 4c C403): lambda0 = 55.74 S cm2/eq (x 1e-4 = 0.005574 S m2/eq), converted by the Nernst relation D = R T lambda0 / (|z| F^2) with R = 8.314462618 J/mol/K, F = 96485.33212 C/mol, T = 298.15 K (RT/F^2 = 2.662848e-07), |z| = 1, to 1.484e-09 m2/s";
            reviewStatus  interim;
